00:00:03.184 --> 00:00:04.280
Integration Suite.

ba0193c8-3f68-4de9-b433-61bce1fa8cb7-0
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.004
This new component allows the integration
of Copiled Studio with SAP in a fully

ba0193c8-3f68-4de9-b433-61bce1fa8cb7-1
00:00:10.004 --> 00:00:11.680
endorsed and compliant way.

0829afc3-a75a-41d1-bfe9-f810e64b4197-0
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.640
When I look at current customer projects,
I can see many different architectures.

33c417ab-fed5-4f11-b5c6-8a1660d5d4e8-0
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:21.916
The new MCP Gateway in SAP Integration
Suite is one of two explicitly mentioned

33c417ab-fed5-4f11-b5c6-8a1660d5d4e8-1
00:00:21.916 --> 00:00:25.840
